households where no one was available at home (column 4).
• Estimated number of persons in refusal households: the reported average household
size (column 1) was applied to the reported number of households that refused to be
enumerated (column 3).
The final estimates classified by regions are recorded in the last three columns of Table 1. The total
estimate was later added to the enumerated households and the institutional population to obtain
the total preliminary counts as presented in this report.
